      "payload": {
        "progress": "Decision (per human coordinator, recorded here + docs/agent-workflow.md's new 'Session ownership' section): warning, never a hard block. Implemented sessionOwnershipWarning(session, actor) in cli/commands/shared.ts (name-only comparison -- kind can legitimately differ per invocation for the same person), wired into plan.ts/stop.ts/done.ts/drop.ts: computed against the pre-mutation session inside the lock, printed via printWarning AFTER the transaction commits (same convention as every other soft warning in this codebase). start.ts is unaffected -- it already gates via --takeover (unchanged). 6 unit tests (shared.test.ts) + 6 CLI-level regression tests across plan/stop/done/drop .test.ts proving warn-but-succeed. Full suite: 1781/1781 pass; typecheck/lint/format clean."
